---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
const query = `SELECT products.name, order_lines.quantity
FROM order_lines
JOIN products
  ON products.product_id = order_lines.product_id
WHERE order_lines.order_id = 'O12';`;
---
<figure class="join-example" id="join-example" aria-labelledby="join-example-title">
  <span class="plate-number">SQL example</span>
  <h3 id="join-example-title">What’s in order O12?</h3>
  <p>For this example, <code>products</code> contains product P7, named “Blue mug”. The <code>order_lines</code> table has one line for order O12: product P7, quantity 2.</p>
  <div class="sql-scroll" role="region" aria-label="SQL query joining order lines to products">
    <Code code={query} lang="sql" theme="css-variables" />
  </div>
  <p class="explanation"><code>ON</code> matches the product IDs. <code>WHERE</code> keeps the lines for O12. <code>SELECT</code> names the two columns we want in the answer.</p>
  <table>
    <caption>Query result</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">name</th><th scope="col">quantity</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr><td>Blue mug</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>
  <figcaption>The name comes from <code>products</code>; the quantity comes from <code>order_lines</code>. The query combines them without changing either table.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .join-example { margin:2rem 0; padding:1.2rem 0; border-block:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); font:.84rem/1.6 var(--font-sans); }
  h3 { margin:.6rem 0 .8rem; font:500 1.4rem/1.3 var(--font-serif); }
  p { font-size:.84rem; margin:.8rem 0; }
  .sql-scroll { overflow-x:auto; }
  .sql-scroll :global(pre) { margin:0; padding:1rem; font:.82rem/1.8 var(--font-mono); --astro-code-foreground:var(--color-text); --astro-code-background:var(--color-surface-alt); --astro-code-token-keyword:var(--teal); --astro-code-token-string-expression:var(--coral); --shiki-dark:var(--color-text); }
  .sql-scroll :global(span[style*="--astro-code-token-keyword"]) { --shiki-dark:var(--teal); }
  .sql-scroll :global(span[style*="--astro-code-token-string-expression"]) { --shiki-dark:var(--coral); }
  .sql-scroll :global(code) { padding:0; background:none; }
  .join-example table { display:table; width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:1rem 0; font:.8rem/1.6 var(--font-mono); }
  caption { text-align:left; font:.8rem/1.6 var(--font-sans); margin-bottom:.4rem; }
  th,td { text-align:left; padding:.45rem .6rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  th { font-weight:500; }
  figcaption { color:var(--color-text-secondary); font:.78rem/1.6 var(--font-sans); }
  .sql-scroll :global(:focus-visible) { outline:2px solid var(--teal); outline-offset:-2px; }
</style>
